  m_Name: Liilia_Hint_Tower
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  lines:
  - "C\u1EADu c\xF3 th\u1EA5y 3 c\xE1i th\xE1p ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc kh\xF4ng."
  - "h\xE3y ho\xE0n th\xE0nh th\u1EED th\xE1ch v\xE0 khi\xEAu chi\u1EBFn t\u1EA1o
    v\u1EADt \u0111\xF3. \u0110\u1EC3 ch\u1EE9ng minh c\u1EADu l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1ECDn."
  - "Ai c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t h\u1EBFt c\xE1c con qu\xE1i m\xE0 l\xE3o
    \u0111\xE3 b\u1EAFt v\xE0 nh\u1ED1t trong t\xF2a th\xE1p s\u1EBD c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7
    t\u01B0 c\xE1ch \u0111\u1EC3 th\xE1ch \u0111\u1EA5u t\u1EA1o v\u1EADt l\xE3o
    t\u1EA1o ra."
  - "H\xE3y l\u1EA7n l\u01B0\u1EE3t k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t t\u1EEBng t\xF2a th\xE1p v\xE0
    ho\xE0n th\xE0nh n\xF3"
